#: polyhost/gui/tap_terms_dialog.py:18
msgid "A key with a tap and a hold action types its tap action when you release it before the tapping term, and acts as its hold action when you hold it longer.<br><br>A tap-hold key pressed within the Flow Tap term after the previous key always types its tap action, so fast typing does not trigger a modifier. 0 turns Flow Tap off.<br><br>The keyboard stores both values."
