msgid "Install WinCompose"
msgstr "Instalar o WinCompose"

#: polyhost/host.py:3667
msgid ""
"WinCompose lets your PolyKybd type any unicode character on Windows — emoji, accents and the language layers all go through it. Without it the keyboard falls back to the far more limited native Windows input.\n"
"\n"
"PolyKybd's build of WinCompose will be downloaded from GitHub and its installer started (Windows will ask you to confirm)."
msgstr ""
"O WinCompose permite que o seu PolyKybd digite qualquer caractere Unicode no Windows — emoji, acentos e as camadas de idioma passam todos por ele. Sem ele, o teclado recorre à entrada nativa do Windows, que é bem mais limitada.\n"
"\n"
"A versão do WinCompose do PolyKybd será baixada do GitHub e o instalador dela será iniciado (o Windows pedirá sua confirmação)."

#: polyhost/host.py:3680
msgid "Looking for the latest WinCompose release…"
msgstr "Procurando a versão mais recente do WinCompose…"

#: polyhost/host.py:3727
msgid ""
"No ready-made installer was found for download.\n"
"\n"
"The releases page will open in your browser — download and run the setup from there."
msgstr ""
"Nenhum instalador pronto foi encontrado para download.\n"
"\n"
"A página de versões será aberta no navegador — baixe e execute o instalador a partir dela."

